VOSR2 vendored code
===================

This directory contains code derived from ComfyUI-VOSR2
(https://github.com/ylchen333/ComfyUI-VOSR2), Copyright (c) ylchen333,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This repository only replaces the ComfyUI host interfaces:
  - comfy.ops            -> ops_compat.py (plain torch.nn layers)
  - comfy.utils.ProgressBar -> progress.py
  - comfy.model_management / comfy.model_patcher / folder_paths /
    Hugging Face auto-download -> loader.py (minimal patcher, explicit root)

The network architecture, forward passes, tiling logic, and color
alignment are kept identical to the upstream implementation.
